{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22467","headline":"登城东古台 · 白居易","name":"登城东古台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢迢东郊上，有土青崔嵬。\n不知何代物，疑是巴王台。\n巴歌久无声，巴宫没黄埃。\n靡靡春草合，牛羊缘四隈。\n我来一登眺，目极心悠哉。\n始见江山势，峰叠水环回。\n凭高视听旷，向远胷襟开。\n唯有故园念，时时东北来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22467.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22467","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}